@base = http://localhost:8090
@token = opsflow-dev-token

### Templates
GET {{base}}/api/workflows
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Triage rules
GET {{base}}/api/triage/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### What would happen, without saving anything
POST {{base}}/api/triage/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Login errors for SSO users", "description": "auth callback fails"}

### Run a workflow by hand (empty body = pick automatically)
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/OPS-1001/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"workflow": "db-incident"}

### Runs of a ticket
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/OPS-1001/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All runs
GET {{base}}/api/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry a failed run from the failed step
@run = paste-a-run-id
POST {{base}}/api/runs/{{run}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
